      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STARLIGHT RIOT (3) is a well performed dog and winner of 16 races who was in the minor money last time out at Healesville (16.85). Has never been out of the money in 22 starts this course and distance. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from three starts. Rates highly and will give a great sight. CARRY ON CASEY (4) goes very well this trip starting 21 times for eight wins and nine minors. Comes off a (22.47) win last time, scoring by 5 lengths in a OPEN over 400m at Gawler. Looks suited here and can measure up. GRAND CHIEF (1) has a strong record here with 20 wins and 16 placings from 53 starts. Was out of placings last time (19.82) at this track in a Best 8, finishing fourth and beaten 1.3 lengths. Looks one of the chances. SON OF MAPLE (2) must be included on latest effort.",
